Kintsugi includes a modified TypeScript port of Microsoft TokenEconomizer.
Source: https://github.com/microsoft/TokenEconomizer
Pinned revision: 81e32e56bb3c4c1b4c9756b429be91e3960116ca
License: Apache License 2.0 (packages/token-economizer/LICENSE).
Adaptations include durable SDK storage/steering, provider-independent inference,
redaction, safe detectors, opt-in controls, classifiers and bounded call savers.
The upstream checkout has no separate NOTICE file.

Selected test-runner and compiler output reducers are adapted from mcp-recall,
Copyright 2026 sakebomb, Apache License 2.0.
Source: https://github.com/sakebomb/mcp-recall
Pinned revision: f00e8c766697b07a8abaf50448feeca918b2a1d6 (1.21.0).
Adapted files: src/handlers/bash-test.ts and src/handlers/bash-compilers.ts.
Changes: typed inputs, local adapters and conservative diagnostic-preservation gates.
License and upstream notice: packages/token-economizer/src/core/output/mcp-recall/.
